labeller in this project (see `accord/differential/run_multillm_replication.py`,
`accord/prevalence_replication/run_prevalence_sweep.py`, and the weak-supervision pool
described in `results/accord/supp/README.md`). Use of Llama 3 is subject to the Meta
Llama 3 Community License; the attribution above is included per section 1.b of that
license.

